WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.000
<v Interviewer>Where did you grow up?

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:05.000
<v Guest>In a small town

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:07.400
<v Guest>near the coast, in the north.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:10.900
<v Guest>My parents ran a bakery there.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:13.000
<v Interviewer>Did you work there too?

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:16.000
<v Guest>Every summer.
